---
title: Typical Matchmaking Flow
config:
  theme: light
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Player Client
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant DB as Database
    participant SM as Server Manager
    participant Worker as Game Server Worker
    rect rgb(150, 190, 230)
    Note over User, Worker: Phase 1: Matchmaking
    User->>API: Login & click "Play" (WebSocket)
    API->>DB: Add user to Waiting Queue
    end
    rect rgb(235, 200, 120)
    Note over User, Worker: Phase 2: Allocation & Setup
    SM->>DB: Poll for queued players
    SM->>Worker: Allocate free worker & send match config
    Worker->>Worker: Spin up Game Server process
    API-->>User: Send Game Server connection info and disconnect
    end
    rect rgb(150, 220, 170)
    Note over User, Worker: Phase 3: Gameplay & Teardown
    User->>Worker: Connect directly & play game
    Worker->>SM: Publish match outcome to workers.results
    SM->>SM: Mark worker as free
    SM->>DB: Save results, remove players from waiting queue
    end
